    "updated_at": "2016-03-11T18:33:57Z",
    "body": "Wait, this needs more work, the spec still says \"Must return a _read only_ array of valid BCP 47 language\" and \"Let new ports be a new _read only_ array consisting of all MessagePort objects in cloneRecord.[[TransferList]], if any, maintaining their relative order.\" in two places.\n\nThat's reference to http://heycam.github.io/webidl/#dfn-read-only which doesn't do much, should instead use http://heycam.github.io/webidl/#idl-frozen-array\n",
